## Highlights
The morphology and adsorption capacity of the Al-MIL-101 analogues were tuned by $\mathrm{Fe}^{3+}$ . ► Fast kinetics, high sorption capacity and strong selectivity were demonstrated. Sorption mechanism of phosphorus on the Fe/Al (0.5) was studied.
